---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Riva Tulpule is a Behavioral Economics & Psychology student at USC, raised in Dubai, exploring consumer insights, brand strategy, and customer experience."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-14 sm:px-8 sm:py-20">
    <p class="font-serif-display text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[var(--color-rust)]">About</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 font-serif-display text-4xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-charcoal)] sm:text-5xl">
      Hey! I'm Riva :)
    </h1>

    <div class="mt-8">
      <img
        src="/images/site/headshot.jpg"
        alt="Riva Tulpule standing in a sunlit colonnade on USC's campus"
        class="aspect-[16/9] w-full rounded-lg object-cover object-top"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-neutral mt-10 max-w-none prose-headings:font-serif-display prose-headings:font-semibold prose-headings:text-[var(--color-charcoal)] prose-p:leading-relaxed prose-p:text-[var(--color-ink)]/90 prose-a:text-[var(--color-brown)] prose-a:font-semibold prose-li:text-[var(--color-ink)]/90 prose-lg">
      <p>
        I've always been curious about why people like what they like, why one product feels worth it and another
        doesn't, and why we trust some brands instantly and question others.
      </p>

      <p>
        I'm currently studying Behavioral Economics and Psychology at USC, where I explore how people make
        decisions and how those decisions are shaped by emotion, environment, and design.
      </p>

      <p>
        What excites me most is translating those insights into something tangible — whether that's rethinking a
        brand, designing an experience, or finding small shifts that change how people interact with a product.
      </p>

      <p>
        Outside of that, I'm someone who pays attention to the little things: the way a menu is structured, how a
        product is packaged, or even how people talk about things they love :)
      </p>

      <h2>What I'm Interested In</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Customer insights and behavior</li>
        <li>Brand strategy and positioning</li>
        <li>Experience and journey design</li>
        <li>How culture and trends shape consumption</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How I Think</h2>
      <p>I tend to approach problems by:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Starting with empathy — understanding how people feel, not just what they do</li>
        <li>Looking at behavior before jumping to solutions</li>
        <li>Breaking down decisions into small, observable patterns</li>
        <li>Finding simple shifts that can meaningfully change how people experience something</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Outside of Work</h2>
      <p>Outside of work, I enjoy:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Trying out new cafes and food spots, and noticing what makes them memorable</li>
        <li>Music and live concerts!</li>
        <li>Staying active — whether that's tennis or trying out new workout classes like spin or F45</li>
        <li>Traveling and observing how people interact with different environments</li>
        <li>
          Being involved in sustainability &amp; social impact work — I founded my own environmental and social
          organization, <a href="/leadership" class="link-underline font-semibold text-[var(--color-brown)]">WeCareDXB</a>!!
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PROFESSIONAL EXPERIENCE -->
  <section class="border-t border-[var(--color-border)] bg-[var(--color-cream-dark)]">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-14 sm:px-8 sm:py-20">
      <h2 class="font-serif-display text-3xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-charcoal)]">Professional Experience</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-base text-[var(--color-ink)]/80">
        A quick look at where I've worked. See the <a href="/work" class="link-underline font-semibold text-[var(--color-brown)]">Work</a> page for full case studies.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 space-y-6">
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-[var(--color-border)] bg-[var(--color-paper)] p-6">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2">
            <h3 class="font-serif-display text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-charcoal)]">
              Consumer Marketing Intern — Al Ghurair Foods
            </h3>
            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-brown)]">May 2026 – Jul 2026 · Dubai, UAE</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-ink)]/85">
            Analyzed NielsenIQ retail data across 15 UAE markets to identify category, pricing, market-share, and
            consumer trends informing brand and commercial strategy. Synthesized consumer, category, and competitor
            insights into executive-ready fact sheets, and evaluated shopper behavior and in-store execution across
            major UAE retailers. See the full <a href="/work/jenan" class="link-underline font-semibold text-[var(--color-brown)]">Jenan case study</a>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-lg border border-[var(--color-border)] bg-[var(--color-paper)] p-6">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2">
            <h3 class="font-serif-display text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-charcoal)]">
              Client Consulting Intern — Nailbiter
            </h3>
            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-brown)]">Jul 2025 – Nov 2025 · Herndon, VA</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-ink)]/85">
            Analyzed 1,000+ shopper videos across 20+ product categories to identify behavioral triggers influencing
            brand choice and purchase decisions, then presented shopper insights and strategic recommendations
            directly to company leadership.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-lg border border-[var(--color-border)] bg-[var(--color-paper)] p-6">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2">
            <h3 class="font-serif-display text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-charcoal)]">
              Travel Trends &amp; Consumer Insights Extern — Expedia Group
            </h3>
            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-brown)]">May 2025 – Jul 2025 · Remote</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-ink)]/85">
            Analyzed digital journeys across 5+ global brands to identify conversion and engagement gaps, and
            developed recommendations to improve retention, personalization, and digital experience based on Gen Z
            behavior patterns.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-lg border border-[var(--color-border)] bg-[var(--color-paper)] p-6">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2">
            <h3 class="font-serif-display text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-charcoal)]">
              Business &amp; Strategy Intern — Covenant Group
            </h3>
            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-brown)]">Jun 2024 – Aug 2024 · Dubai, UAE</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-ink)]/85">
            Analyzed digital marketing performance and optimized content strategy to improve audience engagement,
            and led implementation of a fintech spend platform — coordinating stakeholders and delivering $150K+ in
            annual cost savings.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-lg border border-[var(--color-border)] bg-[var(--color-paper)] p-6">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2">
            <h3 class="font-serif-display text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-charcoal)]">
              Catalyst Cohort Member — ProductSC
            </h3>
            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-brown)]">Jan 2026 – May 2026 · Los Angeles, CA</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-ink)]/85">
            Won 1st place in ProductSC's annual product case competition with a Gen Z engagement strategy for
            Snapchat, and solved 12 team-based product cases combining consumer insights and strategic thinking.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-lg border border-[var(--color-border)] bg-[var(--color-paper)] p-6">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2">
            <h3 class="font-serif-display text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-charcoal)]">
              Community Coordinator — USC Economics Association
            </h3>
            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-brown)]">Sep 2024 – May 2025 · Los Angeles, CA</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-ink)]/85">
            Led branding and marketing strategy using campaign analytics, driving a 30% increase in event attendance.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
